    `s 342(c) — the amount the employer deducts from a wage of` `the total` `, for` `the month as if paid by one employer` `, under` f `, reading Schedule J as` r
        `, column D by branch on an income being` `column D by branch` `, column D at the printed totals on an income being` `column D at the totals`

