        `, reading Schedule J as` r `, column D at the printed totals being` (`column D at the totals` `the income`)
    WHERE
        `the member's month` MEANS k's `the member's month, as if paid by one employer`
        `the income`         MEANS `s 342(c)(1) with s 348(a) — the income the deduction is taken on, from a wage of` `the total` `, for` `the member's month` `, under` f

@ref the rule above; the switch (section "Version 0.3.0"); Schedule K's figures (nii-schedule-k.l4)
GIVEN k                        IS A `A renewed kibbutz member's month under section 342(e1)`
      `the total`              IS A NUMBER
      `column D by branch`     IS A FUNCTION FROM NUMBER TO LIST OF `A branch's column D amount`
      `column D at the totals` IS A FUNCTION FROM NUMBER TO NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 342(e1) — the contributions the renewed kibbutz pays for the member, for` k `, on a total monthly income of` `the total` `, column D by branch on an income being` `column D by branch` `, column D at the printed totals on an income being` `column D at the totals` MEANS
    `s 342(e1) — the contributions the renewed kibbutz pays for the member, for` k `, on a total monthly income of` `the total`
        `, under` (`the figures Schedule K reads for the tax year` (k's `the member's month, as if paid by one employer`'s `tax year`))
        `, reading Schedule J as` `section 342(c) — the reading of Schedule J this row takes where its totals row and its items differ`
        `, column D by branch on an income being` `column D by branch` `, column D at the printed totals on an income being` `column D at the totals`

§§ `342(f) — an employee who is also self-employed`

-- src:3673 | (ו)(1) עובד שהוא גם עובד עצמאי, לא יחולו לגבי הכנסתו, מהמקורות המפורטים בסעיף 2(1) ו־(8) לפקודת מס הכנסה, שיעורי דמי הביטוח החלים לפי לוח י׳ על חלק ההכנסה של עובד עצמאי שאינה עולה על מדרגת הגבייה המופחתת (בסעיף זה – שיעור מופחת).
-- src:3674 | (2) היתה ההכנסה של עובד כאמור, בחודש פלוני, מהמקורות המפורטים בסעיף 2(2) לפקודת מס הכנסה, נמוכה ממדרגת הגבייה המופחתת יחול השיעור המופחת, על סכום הכנסתו מהמקורות המפורטים בסעיף 2(1) ו־(8) לפקודה האמורה, השווה לסכום ההפרש שבין הכנסתו מהמקורות המפורטים בסעיף 2(2) לפקודה, לבין מדרגת הגבייה המופחתת.
-- src:3675 | (3) שר העבודה והרווחה רשאי להתקין תקנות לביצוע סעיף קטן זה.
-- (1) For an employee who is also self-employed, the Schedule J rates for the part of a self-employed
-- person's income not above the reduced collection threshold (the "reduced rate") do not apply to his
-- income from s 2(1) and (8) of the Income Tax Ordinance. (2) If in a month his income from s 2(2)
-- (employment) is "lower than" the threshold, the reduced rate applies to so much of his s 2(1) and (8)
-- income as equals the difference between his s 2(2) income and the threshold.
-- So the s 2(1) and (8) income is split into a part at the reduced rate and a part at the rate above
-- the threshold; the rates themselves are Schedule J's (row IL-04). "lower than" is strict: at the
-- threshold the difference is nil anyway (fork F16).
@ref National Insurance Law s 342(f)(1)-(2) (source lines 3673-3674)
GIVEN e               IS AN `An employee who is also self-employed, in a month`
      `the threshold` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 342(f)(2) — the part of the self-employed income at the reduced rate, for` e `with the threshold at` `the threshold` MEANS
    IF   e's `income from the sources in section 2(2) of the Income Tax Ordinance in the month` LESS THAN `the threshold`
    THEN min (e's `income from the sources in sections 2(1) and 2(8) of the Income Tax Ordinance in the month`)
             (`the threshold` MINUS e's `income from the sources in section 2(2) of the Income Tax Ordinance in the month`)
    ELSE 0

@ref National Insurance Law s 342(f)(1) (source line 3673)
GIVEN e               IS AN `An employee who is also self-employed, in a month`
      `the threshold` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 342(f)(1) — the part of the self-employed income not at the reduced rate, for` e `with the threshold at` `the threshold` MEANS
        e's `income from the sources in sections 2(1) and 2(8) of the Income Tax Ordinance in the month`
    MINUS `s 342(f)(2) — the part of the self-employed income at the reduced rate, for` e `with the threshold at` `the threshold`

@ref s 334(a) (row IL-04): the reduced collection threshold for 2027 and later had not been published on 2026-10-06
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the reduced collection threshold for 2027 and later had not been published when this encoding was made` MEANS
    REFUSE "the reduced collection threshold for 2027 and later had not been published when this encoding was made"

-- The same, with the threshold the Institute publishes for the month's year (2026 only).
@ref National Insurance Law s 342(f)(2) (source line 3674); s 334(a); National Insurance Institute, threshold for 2026
GIVEN e IS AN `An employee who is also self-employed, in a month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 342(f)(2) — the part of the self-employed income at the reduced rate, for` e MEANS
    BRANCH IF e's `tax year` LESS THAN 2026 THEN `this row answers contribution periods from January 2026 only`
           IF e's `tax year` EQUALS   2026 THEN `s 342(f)(2) — the part of the self-employed income at the reduced rate, for` e `with the threshold at` `the reduced collection threshold for 2026, as published by the National Insurance Institute`
           OTHERWISE                            `the reduced collection threshold for 2027 and later had not been published when this encoding was made`
